  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "むじゃきで　ざんこくな　アーカラの\nまもりがみ。　はなの　かぐわしい\nかおりが　エネルギーの　みなもと。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "천진난만하고 잔혹한 아칼라의\n수호신이다. 향기로운\n꽃향기가 에너지의 근원이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "天真無邪但殘酷的阿卡拉守護神。\n鮮花的芳香氣息是牠的能量來源。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Pokémon candide mais terriblement cruel,\nc’est le gardien d’Akala. Il puise son énergie\ndans le parfum entêtant des fleurs.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Der arglose, doch unbarmherzige Schutzpatron\nvon Akala. Seine Energie zieht es aus dem\nlieblichen Duft von Blumen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "El espíritu guardián de Akala, tan inocente como\ncruel. La fragancia de las flores constituye su\nfuente de energía.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Protettore di Akala, è un Pokémon innocente e\nspietato al tempo stesso. Il profumo soave\ndei fiori è la fonte della sua energia.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This guardian deity of Akala is guilelessly cruel.\nThe fragrant aroma of flowers is the source of\nits energy.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "無邪気で　残酷な　アーカラの\n守り神。　花の　芳しい\n香りが　エネルギーの　源。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "天真无邪，残酷的阿卡拉的守护神。\n鲜花的芳香气息是它能量的来源。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "El espíritu guardián de Akala, tan inocente como\ncruel. La fragancia de las flores constituye su\nfuente de energía.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ヒラヒラ　とびまわり　ふしぎに　ひかる\nりんぷんを　ふりまく。　ふれたものは\nたちまち　げんきを　とりもどすという。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "팔랑팔랑 날아다니며 이상하게 빛나는\n인분을 흩뿌린다. 이것에 닿은 자는\n곧 건강을 되찾는다고 한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "四處翩翩飛舞，\n撒下閃著不可思議光芒的鱗粉。\n據說碰到的人眨眼間就會恢復活力。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Avec ses ailes délicates, il répand une poudre\nmystérieuse et lumineuse quand il vole. Il suffit\nde le toucher pour retrouver aussitôt le sourire.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Beim Umherflattern verstreut es geheimnisvoll\nleuchtenden Flügelstaub. Es heißt, wer diesen\nabbekomme, sei sofort wieder voller Energie.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Al revolotear esparce escamas que desprenden\nun brillo misterioso. Se dice que todo aquel que\nlas toca vuelve a sentirse pletórico al instante.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Svolazza nel cielo spargendo nuvole di scaglie\ndal misterioso luccichio che fanno tornare\nimmediatamente il buon umore a chi le tocca.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "As it flutters about, it scatters its strangely\nglowing scales. Touching them is said to restore\ngood health on the spot.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ヒラヒラ　飛びまわり　不思議に　光る\n鱗粉を　振りまく。　触れた者は\nたちまち　元気を　取り戻すという。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "四处翩翩飞舞，\n撒下闪着不可思议光芒的鳞粉。\n据说碰到的人眨眼间就会恢复活力。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Al revolotear esparce escamas que desprenden\nun brillo misterioso. Se dice que todo aquel que\nlas toca vuelve a sentirse pletórico al instante.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "かがやく　りんぷんを　ふりまいて\nひとや　ポケモンの　きずを　いやす。\nアーカラで　まつられる　まもりがみだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "빛나는 인분을 흩뿌려\n사람이나 포켓몬의 상처를 치료한다.\n아칼라에서 모시는 수호신이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會四處散佈閃閃發亮的鱗粉，\n治癒人和寶可夢的傷。\n是阿羅拉的人們信奉的守護神。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "C’est le gardien d’Akala. Il saupoudre une pluie\nd’écailles scintillantes sur les humains\net les Pokémon blessés pour les soigner.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es verteilt leuchtenden Flügelstaub, der die\nWunden von Menschen und Pokémon heilt.\nAuf Akala wird es als Schutzpatron verehrt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Esparce escamas brillantes que curan a las\npersonas y los Pokémon. En la isla de Akala es\nvenerado como su espíritu guardián.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È il Pokémon protettore di Akala.\nSparge luccicanti nuvole di scaglie che\ncurano le ferite di esseri umani e Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It heals the wounds of people and Pokémon by\nsprinkling them with its sparkling scales. This\nguardian deity is worshiped on Akala.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "輝く　りん粉を　振りまいて\n人や　ポケモンの　傷を　癒す。\nアーカラで　祀られる　守り神だ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "会到处撒着闪闪发光的鳞粉，\n治愈人类和宝可梦的伤。\n是阿卡拉所供奉的守护神。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Esparce escamas brillantes que curan a las\npersonas y los Pokémon. En la isla de Akala es\nvenerado como su espíritu guardián.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "まもりがみと　よばれるが　むじゃきで\nざんこくな　せいしつも　あわせもつ\nしぜんのけしんと　いえる　そんざい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "수호신으로 불리지만 천진난만하면서\n잔혹한 성질도 겸비한\n자연의 화신이라 할 수 있는 존재다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "被稱為守護神，卻同時有著\n天真無邪與殘酷的性格，\n可說是大自然的化身。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Bien qu’on le considère comme une divinité\nprotectrice, cette incarnation parfaite de\nla nature est aussi innocente que cruelle.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Obwohl man es Schutzpatron nennt, verkörpert\nsein zugleich unschuldiges und grausames\nGemüt das zwiegespaltene Wesen der Natur.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Este espíritu guardián es tan candoroso como\ndespiadado, por lo que se podría decir que es\nla encarnación de la naturaleza misma.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È considerato il protettore di Akala e\nrappresenta l’incarnazione della natura. Ha\nun’indole innocente e spietata al tempo stesso.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Although called a guardian deity, Tapu Lele is\ndevoid of guilt about its cruel disposition and\ncan be described as nature incarnate.",
